&lt;/section&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an Account Intelligence &amp;amp; Outbound Specialist to help us create meaningful outbound engagement and pipeline opportunities across priority global strategic accounts. You’ll use Talkwalker insights, market signals, account research and hands-on outbound to build commercially relevant, account specific-outbound that creates movement in the accounts that matter most by identifying the right people, moments and messages to activate complex enterprise accounts working alongside two Global Strategic Account Managers. You will be reporting to the Director, Outbound Strategy. Please note that the role may include 10% of travel to events; other Hootsuite offices, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep research across priority global strategic accounts to understand their business context, market environment, brand activity, audience sentiment, competitive landscape and relevant commercial signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage Talkwalker insights, social listening, news, campaign activity, reputation signals and account history to identify timely and relevant reasons to engage prospective customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and map complex buying groups, decision-makers, influencers and stakeholders across global strategic accounts, including marketing, communications, social media, insights, customer care, digital, analytics, procurement, legal, security, Data Privacy, regional teams and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute insight-led, account-specific outbound strategies across email, phone, LinkedIn and other relevant channels, using commercial relevance rather than generic product messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high-value account intelligence assets including signal summaries, one-page account memos, Talkwalker insight snapshots, competitor views, pre-mortems, executive questions and buying-group maps to support strategic account activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic partner to Global Strategic &amp;amp; Principal Account Executives by jointly prioritizing accounts, align on account strategy, and determine the next best outbound actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate account intelligence, stakeholder mapping, outbound activity and strategic learnings within&amp;nbsp; Salesforce, Gong Engage and other relevant systems to support clean data, visibility and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other related duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some years of experience in outbound, sales development, account development, growth, market intelligence, social listening, insights, or a commercially focused research role within a B2B environment or equivalent combination of education / experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with outbound activity, including email, LinkedIn and phone-based outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in and working familiarity with social listening, digital marketing, brand reputation, consumer behaviour, customer insight and market trends, with the ability to turn these signals into commercially relevant account intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong research skills, with the ability to connect account activity, market context, stakeholder priorities and business challenges into a clear reason to engage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to turn complex insight into clear, relevant and human outbound messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of enterprise sales cycles and how strategic account engagement differs from higher-volume prospecting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using Talkwalker, or an equivalent social listening and insights platform is required. Experience with Gong Engage, Salesforce, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, 6sense, Cognism or similar platforms is a strong advantage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional language skills in French, German, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese or Arabic would be desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please note that the role may include up to 10% of travel to client sites and events, other Hootsuite offices, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountability: holds self accountable to meet commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Priority Setting: focuses time and energy on the most important tasks with guidance where needed, clearly understanding how to assess the importance of tasks and decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration and Teamwork: works with others to deliver results, meaningfully contributing to the team and prioritizing team needs over individual needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution seeker: You’re focused on tackling new challenges, solving problems, and moving the business forward—and you don’t wait to be asked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifelong learner: You have a growth mindset – you’re here to learn, experiment, seek, apply, and provide feedback, share what works with your team, and move on from what doesn’t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilient adapter: In the face of change and challenges, you bring a thoughtful, calm approach, and a focus on finding the new opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intentional collaborator. You build positive working relationships across the business, bringing people together to foster new opportunities and to facilitate the efficient flow of information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical challenger: You have the trust in your team to ask difficult questions in order to get to the best end result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active communicator: You listen actively and communicate ideas and information clearly, inclusively, and proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrated thinker: You look beyond your role and responsibilities to understand how your team’s work drives broader organizational goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable owner: You take pride in the work you’re responsible for with a mindset of ultimate accountability and reliability for the outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bar-raiser: You step up to help your team grow and succeed, even when that means going beyond what might be expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In all we do, our six guiding principles light the way:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step Up:&lt;/strong&gt; Dare to go beyond the expected to achieve greatness. #StepUp&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One Team: &lt;/strong&gt;Make Hootsuite a place we soar together by respecting each other&#39;s individuality, building trust, and showing up for the team. #OneTeam #FreeToBeMe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Obsessed: &lt;/strong&gt;Focus relentlessly on helping our customers succeed. #CustomerObsessed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go Fast, Be Agile: &lt;/strong&gt;Widen our competitive advantage by committing to speed and simplicity over perfection and complexity. #GoFastBeAgile&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to Win: &lt;/strong&gt;Commit to building an incredible, profitable company for our customers, our employees, and our stakeholders. #PlayToWin #NoExcuses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Neighbours &amp;amp; Allies: &lt;/strong&gt;Give back to our communities and be an ally. #SocialForGood #Allies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Accommodations will be provided as requested by candidates taking part in all aspects of the selection process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-IA #LI-Hybrid&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Hiring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hootsuite uses artificial intelligence (AI) to support our recruitment process. These tools may assist with screening and assessing applicants and / or summarizing interview feedback. All final hiring decisions are made by human decision-makers who use their professional judgement to review and evaluate relevant candidate information in addition to AI outputs. For more information about how we use AI and your rights, please see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.hootsuite.com/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;Careers Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;73&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;73&quot;&gt;Principal Consultant (Senior Manager) – Trade &amp;amp; Transaction Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;75&quot; data-end=&quot;204&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;75&quot; data-end=&quot;88&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London or Edinburgh (Hybrid) | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;120&quot; data-end=&quot;138&quot;&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;185&quot; data-end=&quot;194&quot;&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;206&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;206&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;Shape the future of global regulatory reporting transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;274&quot; data-end=&quot;286&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;274&quot; data-end=&quot;286&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;288&quot; data-end=&quot;1077&quot;&gt;Capco is seeking a Principal Consultant (Senior Manager) to join our Trade &amp;amp; Transaction Reporting capability within the Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime (FRRF) practice. This role is suited to someone with strong regulatory reporting expertise and proven experience delivering complex, multi-jurisdictional transformation programmes. You&#39;ll work with leading global financial institutions to implement regulatory change, strengthen reporting controls, and optimise reporting operating models across regimes including EMIR Refit, MiFIR, SFTR, CFTC, MAS, and HKMA. You&#39;ll also leverage approved AI tools and AI-enabled ways of working to improve analysis, accelerate delivery, and enhance reporting quality while applying responsible AI practices and appropriate human oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1079&quot; data-end=&quot;1097&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1079&quot; data-end=&quot;1097&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1099&quot; data-end=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ooky46&quot; data-start=&quot;1099&quot; data-end=&quot;1350&quot;&gt;Lead and deliver trade and transaction reporting transformation initiatives across multiple global regulatory regimes, identifying opportunities to leverage AI-enabled workflows and automation to improve reporting quality and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x7pb1y&quot; data-start=&quot;1351&quot; data-end=&quot;1577&quot;&gt;Support regulatory implementation, remediation, and control optimisation across EMIR Refit, MiFIR, SFTR, CFTC, MAS, HKMA, and other reporting frameworks, translating regulatory requirements into practical business solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wt2dd8&quot; data-start=&quot;1578&quot; data-end=&quot;1795&quot;&gt;Analyse and enhance reporting architectures, data lineage, reconciliations, and data quality frameworks, using AI-enabled analytics where appropriate to improve transparency, traceability, and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2o5xzk&quot; data-start=&quot;1796&quot; data-end=&quot;1988&quot;&gt;Guide the implementation of regulatory reporting platforms and RegTech solutions while ensuring appropriate governance, validation, and oversight where AI-assisted capabilities are utilised.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gto1px&quot; data-start=&quot;1989&quot; data-end=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;Build strong client relationships while contributing to business development, proposition development, mentoring, and the continued growth of Capco&#39;s Regulatory Reporting capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2175&quot; data-end=&quot;2201&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2175&quot; data-end=&quot;2201&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2203&quot; data-end=&quot;2998&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qhmmbg&quot; data-start=&quot;2203&quot; data-end=&quot;2376&quot;&gt;Strong experience delivering trade or transaction reporting transformation across one or more global regulatory regimes within financial services or management consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cvq3v6&quot; data-start=&quot;2377&quot; data-end=&quot;2500&quot;&gt;Good knowledge of Capital Markets products including OTC derivatives, listed derivatives, equities, fixed income, and FX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;94fvdg&quot; data-start=&quot;2501&quot; data-end=&quot;2635&quot;&gt;Experience with reporting controls, reconciliations, data quality governance, operating models, and regulatory reporting frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;y9bsq&quot; data-start=&quot;2636&quot; data-end=&quot;2781&quot;&gt;Broad understanding of Capital Markets functions including Front Office, Middle Office, Risk, Treasury, Operations, Compliance, and Technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hrczp5&quot; data-start=&quot;2782&quot; data-end=&quot;2998&quot;&gt;Excellent stakeholder management, analytical, and communication skills, with experience using approved AI tools to enhance analysis, productivity, and decision-making while maintaining sound professional judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3000&quot; data-end=&quot;3020&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3000&quot; data-end=&quot;3020&quot;&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3022&quot; data-end=&quot;3643&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jrquz4&quot; data-start=&quot;3022&quot; data-end=&quot;3153&quot;&gt;Experience with regulatory reporting platforms such as DTCC, UnaVista, Regnology, SteelEye, Kaizen, or similar RegTech solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;a8ek0k&quot; data-start=&quot;3154&quot; data-end=&quot;3257&quot;&gt;Understanding of enterprise data lineage, reporting traceability, schema design, and data governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ncc330&quot; data-start=&quot;3258&quot; data-end=&quot;3384&quot;&gt;Experience supporting RegTech, AI-enabled reporting, workflow automation, or real-time reporting transformation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1joiw9a&quot; data-start=&quot;3385&quot; data-end=&quot;3496&quot;&gt;Awareness of regulatory consultations, industry working groups, or transaction reporting policy developments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hprpc2&quot; data-start=&quot;3497&quot; data-end=&quot;3643&quot;&gt;Experience supporting business development, proposition development, mentoring colleagues, or leading workstreams within consulting engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
