&lt;p data-start=&quot;81&quot; data-end=&quot;197&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;81&quot; data-end=&quot;94&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;131&quot;&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;178&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;Build resilience where it matters most across cyber, technology, and third-party risk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;290&quot; data-end=&quot;302&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;290&quot; data-end=&quot;302&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;304&quot; data-end=&quot;1051&quot;&gt;Capco is seeking experienced Principal Consultants in Operational Resilience and Cyber Risk to join our growing Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime (FRRF) capability. In this senior role, you&#39;ll lead complex client engagements across financial services and energy, advising on regulatory expectations such as PRA and DORA while driving the design and implementation of robust resilience frameworks. You&#39;ll play a key role in shaping client strategy, leading transformation programmes, and contributing to capability growth. You&#39;ll also leverage approved AI tools and AI-enabled ways of working to enhance analysis, accelerate insight generation, and improve delivery while applying responsible AI practices and appropriate human oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1053&quot; data-end=&quot;1071&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1053&quot; data-end=&quot;1071&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1073&quot; data-end=&quot;2128&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rthtdt&quot; data-start=&quot;1073&quot; data-end=&quot;1281&quot;&gt;Lead operational resilience assessments, scenario testing, and control implementation programmes, identifying opportunities to leverage AI-enabled workflows and automation to strengthen resilience outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;48qtxm&quot; data-start=&quot;1282&quot; data-end=&quot;1484&quot;&gt;Advise clients on regulatory readiness across PRA, DORA, and other resilience frameworks, translating regulatory expectations into practical transformation strategies and sustainable operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;l0hcc&quot; data-start=&quot;1485&quot; data-end=&quot;1676&quot;&gt;Oversee cyber risk, third-party risk, and vendor resilience assessments, using AI-enabled analytics where appropriate to strengthen risk identification, prioritisation, and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;891f5z&quot; data-start=&quot;1677&quot; data-end=&quot;1908&quot;&gt;Design and implement governance models, dashboards, Important Business Services (IBS), Impact Tolerance (ITOL), and reporting frameworks, ensuring robust governance, validation, and oversight where AI-assisted tools are utilised.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;okywhs&quot; data-start=&quot;1909&quot; data-end=&quot;2128&quot;&gt;Lead cyber and technology resilience transformation initiatives, including tooling, cloud security, and control enhancements, while contributing to business development, proposition development, and capability growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2156&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2156&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
