&lt;p data-start=&quot;51&quot; data-end=&quot;167&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;51&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;83&quot; data-end=&quot;101&quot;&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;148&quot; data-end=&quot;157&quot;&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;169&quot; data-end=&quot;232&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;169&quot; data-end=&quot;232&quot;&gt;Empower finance leadership through strategic transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;234&quot; data-end=&quot;246&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;234&quot; data-end=&quot;246&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;248&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;Capco is looking for Principal Consultants to join our growing Finance Transformation capability within the Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime (FRRF) practice. You&#39;ll play a key role in helping CFOs, Treasurers, and senior finance leaders maximise the value of their finance and treasury functions through operating model redesign, process transformation, and strategic technology delivery. You&#39;ll also leverage approved AI tools and AI-enabled ways of working to improve analysis, accelerate insight generation, and enhance delivery while applying responsible AI practices and appropriate human oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;883&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;883&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;885&quot; data-end=&quot;1953&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g6k904&quot; data-start=&quot;885&quot; data-end=&quot;1142&quot;&gt;Deliver finance transformation programmes spanning regulatory change (including Basel, IFRS, and PRA), finance technology, process optimisation, and operating model transformation, identifying opportunities to leverage AI-enabled workflows and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8edbjo&quot; data-start=&quot;1143&quot; data-end=&quot;1357&quot;&gt;Partner with CFOs, Treasurers, and C-suite stakeholders to implement finance strategies, strengthen controls, and optimise regulatory reporting, including ICAAP, ILAAP, and Recovery and Resolution Planning (RRP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;klrobx&quot; data-start=&quot;1358&quot; data-end=&quot;1558&quot;&gt;Define business requirements and manage end-to-end project delivery across finance, treasury, and regulatory change initiatives, ensuring appropriate governance where AI-assisted tools are utilised.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qghjdh&quot; data-start=&quot;1559&quot; data-end=&quot;1758&quot;&gt;Design and implement stress testing frameworks across credit, market, and liquidity risk to support regulatory compliance and strategic decision-making, using AI-enabled analysis where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19yvcni&quot; data-start=&quot;1759&quot; data-end=&quot;1953&quot;&gt;Collaborate with technology teams to embed digital, automation, and AI-enabled solutions into finance processes, architecture, and operating models to improve efficiency and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1955&quot; data-end=&quot;1981&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1955&quot; data-end=&quot;1981&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1983&quot; data-end=&quot;2694&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1560vvf&quot; data-start=&quot;1983&quot; data-end=&quot;2092&quot;&gt;Experience delivering finance transformation programmes within financial services or management consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;yu5i43&quot; data-start=&quot;2093&quot; data-end=&quot;2210&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of finance operating models, accounting processes, regulatory change, and financial reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1p5bqfv&quot; data-start=&quot;2211&quot; data-end=&quot;2341&quot;&gt;Experience with finance technology implementations, including ERP platforms, subledgers, automation, and optimisation solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1na2nhp&quot; data-start=&quot;2342&quot; data-end=&quot;2532&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with experience using approved AI tools to enhance analysis, productivity, and decision-making while maintaining sound professional judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tj29qq&quot; data-start=&quot;2533&quot; data-end=&quot;2694&quot;&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, with the ability to influence audiences from project teams through to CFOs and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
