&lt;p data-start=&quot;309&quot; data-end=&quot;1043&quot;&gt;Capco is seeking experienced Managing Principals / Directors to join our Cyber &amp;amp; Operational Resilience capability. In this senior leadership role, you&#39;ll act as a strategic advisor and delivery lead, partnering with leading financial institutions to design and implement end-to-end resilience solutions. You&#39;ll play a critical role in shaping client strategy, leading complex transformation programmes, and driving growth across our Risk practice. You&#39;ll also champion AI-enabled ways of working, helping clients and teams responsibly adopt approved AI tools, automation, and data-driven insights to strengthen resilience, improve decision-making, and accelerate delivery while maintaining appropriate governance and human oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
