&lt;p&gt;Mozilla understands that valuing diverse creative practices and forms of knowledge are crucial to and enrich the company’s core mission.&amp;nbsp; We encourage applications from everyone, including members of all equity-seeking communities, such as (but certainly not limited to) women, racialized and Indigenous persons, persons with disabilities, persons of all sexual orientation&lt;span style=&quot;color: #003366;&quot;&gt;s, &lt;/span&gt;gender identities, and expressions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that qualified individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, as appropriate. Please contact us at &lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; ---------- to request accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race (including hairstyle and texture), religion (including religious grooming and dress practices), gender, gender identity, gender expression, color, national origin, pregnancy, ancestry, domestic partner status, disability, sexual orientation, age, genetic predisposition, medical condition, marital status, citizenship status, military or veteran status, or any other basis covered by applicable laws.&amp;nbsp; Mozilla will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics or any other unlawful behavior, conduct, or purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Group: C&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Req ID: R3214&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Ranges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Remote UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£111,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£148,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3001 - Director, Intelligence (Strategic Operations) - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, AI, Data, People and partners together to create limitless&lt;br&gt;opportunities for growth. For more information, visit www.wppmedia.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The UK is the largest market within the WPP Media EMEA region, with over 4,500 people employed&lt;br&gt;within the WPP Media ecosystem. Marquee UK key clients include the likes of Amazon, UK Government, BT, Tesco, Coca Cola, Bayer, Dell, Unilever, M&amp;amp;S, Ford, Nestle, Mazda, Danone and&lt;br&gt;Colgate. We have a bold ambition: to make WPP Media UK the undisputed leader in our industry.&lt;br&gt;We are evolving our business operating model, our ways of working and placing data, technology&lt;br&gt;and AI at the heart of everything we do for our people and our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ONE WPP – Vision &#39;30&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join us in shaping the future of our industry with Vision &#39;30 – our ambitious strategy to lead in the&amp;nbsp;AI era. We are revolutionizing our business to unlock limitless growth opportunities for our clients&amp;nbsp;and ourselves, built on four core priorities:&lt;br&gt;1. Collaboration: Foster unprecedented levels of data collaboration across WPP and&amp;nbsp;partners through WPP Open, turning every channel into a smarter opportunity.&lt;br&gt;2. Data &amp;amp; Technology: Leverage our AI-powered Open Intelligence solution, connecting&amp;nbsp;vast data to uncover unique insights, deliver predictive performance and superior brand&amp;nbsp;experiences through our globally consistent DPAM process.&lt;br&gt;3. Innovation: Drive true innovation by generating intelligence from trillions of privacy-bydefault data points, focusing on the &#39;why&#39; behind customer behaviour to create unparalleled competitive advantages.&lt;br&gt;4. People: Developing future-ready talent involves evolving our focus from traditional media planning to strategic business outcomes, advanced technology and real-time measurable results, as AI increasingly automates media investment by 2030.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We empower ambitious experts to deliver extraordinary work by challenging ordinary thinking. If&lt;br&gt;you are passionate about an AI-driven future, thrive in a collaborative and data-centric environment, and are driven to deliver unparalleled growth, we invite you to be part of our transformative journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is a single client centric company with a portfolio of go to market brands. Wavemaker, EssenceMediacom, Mindshare and T&amp;amp;P are our agency teams, these house multiple local and global clients. In addition, we have several dedicated client brands, such as OpenDoor (Amazon), MFG (Google), OpenMind (Nestle), OpenConnect (BT/EE) and Media Futures Group (Google). All of these teams are supported by consistent capabilities, enterprise level tools and systems and our market leading OPEN platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media Group Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media Group Operations is a central function within WPP, dedicated to driving operational&amp;nbsp;excellence and efficiency across the business. The team is an enabling function for WPP Media,&amp;nbsp;supporting our client facing teams to transform their capabilities and deliver a seamless service&amp;nbsp;for their clients. Committed to providing best-in-class services and solutions to our clients, enabling them to achieve their business objectives through innovative and effective media strategies. We foster a collaborative and dynamic environment where individuals can thrive and&amp;nbsp;contribute to the success of the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Director is a senior delivery and operational consultancy role within the Intelligence pillar of Strategic Operations. Working closely with the Director, Intelligence, the role will take ownership of defined client and UK-wide workstreams across taxonomy, CCUID adoption, Campaign Governance, data quality and reporting enablement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role sits between the Manager and the Director roles. It requires greater independence, judgement and stakeholder leadership than the Manager role, while remaining focused on translating the Intelligence strategy into practical delivery rather than owning the overall strategy or technical capability roadmap.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Director will lead discovery, shape recommendations, coordinate implementation and drive adoption across Planning, Activation, Analytics, Finance, Data &amp;amp; Technology and product teams. They will create structure within ambiguous environments, proactively manage delivery risks and bring clear options and recommendations to the Director, Intelligence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Attributes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Highly organised and proactive, with the ability to take ownership of multiple workstreams and maintain momentum without constant direction.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the confidence to communicate complex subjects clearly and concisely.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong stakeholder management and facilitation skills, with the ability to build trust and bring together teams with different priorities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Curious and comfortable asking detailed questions to understand how campaigns, systems, data and reporting processes work in practice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Able to create structure from ambiguity, identify root causes and turn complex challenges into practical recommendations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Confident sharing ideas, constructively challenging existing approaches and influencing without direct authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong attention to detail while retaining sight of wider business, client and reporting outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Collaborative, pragmatic and adaptable, with a genuine interest in helping teams adopt better ways of working.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Able to balance strategic thinking with hands-on delivery, documentation and follow-through.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Comfortable escalating risks and decisions with clear context, options and a recommended course of action.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Essential Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience owning and delivering cross-functional projects or workstreams within media, marketing, operations, transformation, data governance, business intelligence or technology environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Demonstrable experience leading discovery workshops, gathering requirements and mapping end-to-end processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience translating business needs into delivery plans, process improvements, governance approaches or technical requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong experience managing senior stakeholders and coordinating activity across teams that do not directly report into the role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience creating clear playbooks, process documentation, recommendations, status updates or training materials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;A practical understanding of change adoption, including stakeholder engagement, feedback, training and ongoing improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Proven ability to independently manage milestones, actions, risks, dependencies and delivery decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Desirable Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience of media campaign workflows, including briefing, planning, buying, activation, finance or reporting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Exposure to taxonomy, naming conventions, unique identifiers, campaign governance, data quality or compliance monitoring.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience working with Analytics, Data &amp;amp; Technology, engineering or product teams to shape and test solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Familiarity with WPP Open, Campaign Governance, Campaign Performance, Power BI or comparable workflow and reporting platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;An understanding of how consistent campaign data supports reliable reporting, measurement and operational efficiency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience coaching junior colleagues or coordinating contributors supporting a wider workstream.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Measures of Success&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Assigned workstreams progress with clear plans, ownership and stakeholder alignment, requiring limited day-to-day intervention from the VP, Intelligence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Discovery findings are converted into clear requirements, practical recommendations and implementable next steps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Taxonomy, CCUID and Campaign Governance approaches are usable within real team workflows and are consistently understood by relevant stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;The appropriate stakeholders, workspaces, access requirements, systems and reporting dependencies are identified early in delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Planning, Activation, Analytics, Finance, Data &amp;amp; Technology and product teams remain engaged and accountable throughout implementation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Risks, blockers and decisions are surfaced early, accompanied by clear options and recommendations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Playbooks, implementation guidance and training materials are accurate, practical and reusable across future client rollouts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Adoption and data-quality issues are identified, tracked and addressed through agreed follow-up and governance processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Learning from client implementations is captured and used to improve the Intelligence pillar’s repeatable delivery approach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;The VP, Intelligence has greater capacity to focus on pillar strategy, senior stakeholder alignment and future capability development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them&amp;nbsp;do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to&amp;nbsp;pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health&amp;nbsp;awareness days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without&amp;nbsp;discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in&amp;nbsp;which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&amp;nbsp;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and&amp;nbsp;connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four&amp;nbsp;days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team&amp;nbsp;during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy) for more&amp;nbsp;information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3214 - Director, AI Enablement - GCS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Director, AI Enablement to oversee enablement activities across a portfolio of client accounts within the Open Media Studio ecosystem. This role is ideal for someone who thrives in a hands-on environment, working closely with clients, agencies, and internal teams to drive adoption, engagement, and measurable value from WPP Media products. You will be responsible for ensuring that enablement plans are executed effectively, that client teams are trained and supported, and that feedback loops are established to continuously improve the client experience. You will work alongside regional and global enablement leaders to ensure your cluster’s enablement efforts align with WPP Media’s broader business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Enablement Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage enablement programs for a portfolio of smaller client accounts within your cluster. Ensure clients are onboarded effectively, trained on OMS products (including Open Media Assistant/ Agent Hub and Open Intelligence), and supported through adoption phases. Partner with account teams to identify opportunities to expand product usage and deliver measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Enablement Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct product walkthroughs, demos, and training sessions tailored to client needs. Support change management initiatives to help client teams transition to OMS-enabled workflows. Provide practical guidance and best practices to drive day-to-day adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Liaison:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary enablement contact for your cluster, connecting clients with product, engineering, and data strategy teams. Gather and relay client feedback to inform product improvements and roadmap priorities. Coordinate with regional enablement peers to share learnings and ensure consistency across accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Studio Integration &amp;amp; Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Where required, facilitate integration with the Open team on cross-studio deployments, ensuring seamless coordination between Open Media Studio and other WPP studios within client workflows. Uphold governance models for cross-studio global client solutions, eliminating operational gaps and inefficiencies. Represent OMS Enablement in relevant cross-studio workstreams (e.g., pilots, joint initiatives) to drive alignment, accelerate deployment readiness, and ensure consistent, high-quality execution across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Tracking &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor adoption metrics, engagement levels, and client satisfaction within your cluster. Identify trends and areas for improvement, and work with the regional enablement led to adjust strategies accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support for Growth &amp;amp; Retention:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in new business pitches and client retention efforts by showcasing OMS capabilities. Develop enablement materials, case studies, and success stories that highlight value delivered to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in client enablement, customer success, or training within a technology or data-driven organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of technology platforms and ability to act as a confident product advocate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to build trust and influence stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively across functions and manage multiple client priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with the ability to interpret adoption data and translate insights into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with media planning and buying workflows is a plus but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3072 - Associate Director, Planning, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are recruiting for an Account Director who is an exceptional and driven media planner, to join our Connections Planning team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We foster a highly collaborative environment with brilliant, forward-thinking clients who are not only engaged but genuinely enthusiastic about pushing boundaries. This partnership allows us to deliver truly exciting, market-leading work that sets industry benchmarks and drives significant impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expect a role that is highly strategic, requiring deep analytical thinking, a keen commercial eye, and a flair for innovative solutions. We are consistently exploring new technologies, channels, and audience engagement models, ensuring your work remains at the cutting edge. Innovation is not just encouraged, it&#39;s expected.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, you&#39;ll have seamless access to a rich tapestry of agency expertise. You&#39;ll collaborate daily with our specialist teams in data science, advanced measurement &amp;amp; analytics, brand strategy, and consumer insights. This integrated approach empowers you to craft media plans that are not only creative and impactful but also deeply informed, measurable, and strategically sound.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;About the role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be expected to demonstrate experience and knowledge in -&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowing the tools and means to build and target audiences in addressable and non-addressable media to validate the media approach ensuring that the defined audience can be reached at the scale required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing an approach that outlines how and where we will connect with defined audiences – especially hard to reach / low media engagement audiences – in media for brand and performance campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connecting the dots between the data we, the client, media owners and other internal teams hold to plan most effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing the connections ecosystem &amp;amp; plan, working closely and collaboratively with channel specialists and wider agency teams from a paid, owned and earned perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Day to day management of campaigns and annual planning as a key liaison between clients and channel specialists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing measurement &amp;amp; testing framework to inform as well as measure and optimise the campaigns when live&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of others to develop their skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You show a breadth of understanding of all media channels and can confidently discuss the role they play within a comms strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an interest in both brand and performance campaigns with some knowledge of ecommerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a tool ‘wizard’...well not quite but excellent knowledge of audience research and planning tools (e.g. TGI &amp;amp; Touchpoints) is a must and awareness of / familiarity with alternative sources (such as media owner tools &amp;amp; data) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to draw clear insights and implications for media (i.e. connecting the outputs of different insight systems successfully)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a passion for media and understanding of what makes a great media campaign, tangibly showcasing excellence in planning craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take responsibility for the upfront work that needs to happen in order to deliver a great, clear and concise universal brief to the specialist teams that hits the clients&#39; brief on the head&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about proving your campaigns work! How? By being able to create a holistic measurement framework relevant for your brand and applicable to every campaign that is digestible (setting KPI’s methods I.e., which tool/system, necessary tracking) and plan for adaptation/optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are confident in presenting with passion and conviction, managing senior client relationships, running all agency team sessions and collaboratively leading client projects and tackling challenging conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are excited to work as part of a team; immediate, wider department and specialists as required. Leading by example though presence and contribution. Taking the responsibility for working in a collaborative, inclusive way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate excellent attention to detail and accuracy in output and meeting deadlines. As well as strong organization to meet client expectations, manage workflow for self and junior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a proactive desire to continually improve own knowledge and wider skill set&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are open minded, flexible and have a challenger mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3133 - Associate Director, Commerce, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an eCommerce Associate Director, you will be responsible for the coordination and delivery of your client accounts across platforms whilst operating as the main campaign activation point of contact for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Utilising platform expertise and account management practices, you’ll ensure effective management of projects to brief, schedule and budget. Ultimately, you’ll work to deliver industry-leading eCommerce campaigns which exceed our clients’ expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will involve line management of more junior members of the team, overseeing their work and development to successfully deliver to client expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work across well-known brands with a desire for innovation and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working within a truly collaborative agency model with great opportunities for continued cross-media and performance marketing learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A talented team supporting each other in implementing best-in-class, award winning campaigns, and has fun along the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measures of success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;In three months, you would have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven to be the day-to-day lead for client contacts as well as internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseen the team’s workflow management, from brief to post-campaign analysis, striving for operational effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensured that client objectives and KPI targets are understood and optimised towards every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proposed short and long-term optimisations to develop the accounts and deliver improved performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenged inherited ways of working with your own ideas for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 12 months, you would have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gained a complete understanding of the clients’ business and their needs, and shaped the eCommerce strategy in line with it, whilst incorporating industry developments and market changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an extension of the clients’ teams, providing added value for eCommerce and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shown to be proactive, and a real driver who inspires direct reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities of the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specialist Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsibility for the output of your team, both client facing and operational, and accountability for adherence to controls and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic understanding of the clients’ business and KPIs, keeping up to date with latest industry news and proactively spotting trends, product releases, and other opportunities which could enhance our activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a forward thinking and innovative approach in the development of all activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong relationships with your client and key suppliers, leading team communications with these stakeholders. Be able to communicate with clients on subject matters (even outside of your remit) and provide them with useful insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take responsibility for your team’s development and career progression within the agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play an active role in recruitment and interviewing processes to build strong teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;External and Internal Communication &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication lead with the client contacts, media partners and internal stakeholders with the support of the Senior Associate Director when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong relationships with your client, and key suppliers. Foster a good working relationship across client team stakeholders to facilitate flawless execution of plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process and Systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping to drive process automation through adoption of technology and efficient ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead on application and adherence to all areas of activation related finance process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributes to the development of strategic revenue and services opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;In-depth understanding of eCommerce campaign set-up, management, optimisation and reporting across media owner and technology vendor platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of the strategic and tactical application of eCommerce and digital marketing in general&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven project management, leadership and people management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
